    "detail": "16 ritual registry rows claim PROPOSED_NEW for a key the graph already holds: 11 materials and 5 offerings. The plan resolves each against the graph rather than the marking, so no duplicate is created, but an importer trusting node_status would have written new ritual properties onto existing canonical Concepts.",
