    "redirect_detail": "3 rites are ALREADY_MODELLED_AS_SOCIALRITE. Two of their own keys are absent from the graph, so treating the status as ordinary would have created duplicate rite nodes for PITRMEDHA and GRHAPRAVESA, which the graph already holds as PITRYANA-FUNERARY-RITE and SALA-HOUSE-BUILDING.",
